OL,3,GNEWSAFour in court over murder of
OL,4,Anewborn baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people accused of murdering a
OL,7,Fnewborn baby at a house in Sheffield
OL,8,Fhave appeared in court.
OL,10,FMaria Skopova suffered 33 wounds in 15
OL,11,Fseparate stabbings on 30 August - the
OL,12,Fday she was born - before being found
OL,13,Fby police at a house in Holywell
OL,14,FHeights, in the Wincobank area of the
OL,15,Fcity.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
