OL,3,GNEWSAFour in court over murder of
OL,4,Anewborn baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrea Skopova, 20, Peter Horvath, 19,
OL,7,FPeter Horvath, 38, and Nina Horvathova,
OL,8,F37, appeared earlier at Sheffield Crown
OL,9,FCourt charged with murder. A
OL,10,F15-year-old girl charged with
OL,11,Fperverting the course of justice also
OL,12,Fappeared.
OL,14,FNo pleas were entered by the defendants
OL,15,Fon Friday and a further hearing was
OL,16,Ffixed for 14 December.
